=== Vowels ===
Leco has six vowel phonemes: /a/, /e/, /i/, /o/, /u/ and /è/.<!-- The transcription of this vowel is not further elaborated upon in the source --> The opposition among the first five vowels is distinguished in the data, but the opposition between /e/ and /è/ is found only in a limited number of words, as for example ''pele'' 'balsa' <!-- [[es:Idioma leco]] has "balsa" and [[wikt:balsa#Spanish]] has 4 definitions --> and ''pèlè'' 'name of plant'.

